such a real performance?

1132
01:14:30,180 --> 01:14:33,820
What, a rocket is running
wild through the subway?!

1133
01:14:37,860 --> 01:14:40,780
A train will be arriving
at Platform 1 shortly.

1134
01:14:42,120 --> 01:14:42,480
What?

1135
01:14:50,080 --> 01:14:51,980
We've just received this news.

1136
01:14:52,500 --> 01:14:56,880
The rocket that escaped the explosion
is now tearing through the subway.

1137
01:14:57,480 --> 01:15:00,220
Also, aside from the
high-performance explosives,

1138
01:15:00,220 --> 01:15:04,320
it appears Officer Ryotsu of the Kameari
Kōen-mae Police Box is aboard the rocket.

1139
01:15:08,580 --> 01:15:09,720
We're from the Katsushika police.

1140
01:15:09,720 --> 01:15:10,440
We've been waiting for you.

1141
01:15:11,700 --> 01:15:12,220
Ryotsu's...

1142
01:15:15,460 --> 01:15:18,160
That's the rocket Senpai is riding in!

1143
01:15:19,160 --> 01:15:20,460
What incredible speed!

1144
01:15:22,740 --> 01:15:25,740
Wow, it's moving through the
Otemachi station concourse.

1145
01:15:25,740 --> 01:15:29,320
Don't tell me it's going to transfer from
the Chiyoda Line to the Marunouchi Line!

1146
01:15:31,560 --> 01:15:33,840
A rocket switching subway lines?

1147
01:15:36,820 --> 01:15:37,680
Get out of the way!

1148
01:15:57,740 --> 01:16:00,180
Oh no! Another train is
coming from the front!

1149
01:16:04,860 --> 01:16:06,420
At this rate, we're going to crash!

1150
01:16:06,420 --> 01:16:08,400
It's no use, we can't avoid it!

1151
01:16:09,180 --> 01:16:15,300
What... what is it?

1152
01:16:15,300 --> 01:16:18,100
There's no subway running over there!

1153
01:16:18,100 --> 01:16:21,200
I see, it's the tunnel Ryotsu dug.

1154
01:16:22,640 --> 01:16:24,020
Ryotsu dug it!

1155
01:16:33,540 --> 01:16:35,840
Now it's moved onto the Hibiya Line.

1156
01:16:35,840 --> 01:16:38,640
At this rate, it'll come back to Katsushika!

1157
01:16:44,120 --> 01:16:46,060
What on earth are we supposed to do?

1158
01:16:46,580 --> 01:16:47,420
Ohara-kun.

1159
01:16:47,420 --> 01:16:48,300
Headquarters.

1160
01:16:49,680 --> 01:16:51,260
Orders have come down from headquarters.

1161
01:16:51,260 --> 01:16:54,600
The rocket is to be detonated
within Katsushika Ward.

1162
01:16:54,600 --> 01:16:56,000
What?!

1163
01:16:58,020 --> 01:17:02,160
Katsushika has already completed its evacuation, so it's safe,
but

1164
01:17:02,160 --> 01:17:05,760
if it explodes in another district,
there will be many casualties.

1165
01:17:05,760 --> 01:17:08,920
Fortunately,
the bomb is heading toward Katsushika.

1166
01:17:09,460 --> 01:17:11,120
There's no other way.

1167
01:17:11,600 --> 01:17:13,360
What's going to happen to Senpai?

1168
01:17:13,360 --> 01:17:16,860
That's right! Are you saying Ryo-chan doesn't matter,
no matter what happens to him?

1169
01:17:16,860 --> 01:17:20,660
It can't be helped.
That's headquarters' decision.

1170
01:17:24,100 --> 01:17:24,700
N-no way...

1171
01:17:43,220 --> 01:17:46,700
Chief, are you saying we should
abandon Ryo-san and Katsushika?

1172
01:17:46,700 --> 01:17:50,660
Ryo-chan is risking his
life to protect Katsushika!

1173
01:17:51,880 --> 01:17:55,480
Chief, I hear the detonator
installation is complete.

1174
01:18:05,540 --> 01:18:07,660
Ryotsu, don't you dare come back!

1175
01:18:08,420 --> 01:18:09,340
Ohara!

1176
01:18:09,720 --> 01:18:12,680
If it comes back to Katsushika,
the rocket will explode!

1177
01:18:12,800 --> 01:18:16,220
What?! At this rate,
it'll head right back to Katsushika!

1178
01:18:16,220 --> 01:18:16,440
Whoa!

1179
01:18:17,840 --> 01:18:20,260
Damn it! I'll deal with this myself!

1180
01:18:20,920 --> 01:18:34,060
Whoa! It vanished!

1181
01:18:34,220 --> 01:18:35,200
Where to?

1182
01:18:35,580 --> 01:18:36,460
Aboveground!

1183
01:18:56,680 --> 01:18:59,100
The rocket has come up to
the surface from Ueno Station.

1184
01:18:59,100 --> 01:19:01,800
Ohara-kun, what have you done?

1185
01:19:02,280 --> 01:19:05,720
Please let that idiot handle
things here for a little while.

1186
01:19:06,440 --> 01:19:09,320
But I will take full responsibility.

1187
01:19:09,320 --> 01:19:09,940
Please.

1188
01:19:17,280 --> 01:19:18,680
Whoa, that was close!

1189
01:19:18,680 --> 01:19:20,500
It's going to explode!

1190
01:19:34,680 --> 01:19:36,820
The rocket carrying the bomb is currently

1191
01:19:36,820 --> 01:19:39,400
speeding down Chūō-dōri toward Kanda.

1192
01:19:39,760 --> 01:19:40,840
As for the bomb's fate,

1193
01:19:40,840 --> 01:19:42,660
the Kameari Kōen-mae Police Box

1194
01:19:42,660 --> 01:19:45,380
seems to have entrusted it
to Officer Kankichi Ryotsu.

1195
01:19:48,760 --> 01:19:53,240
The rocket still carries
the high-performance bomb.

1196
01:19:53,240 --> 01:19:56,600
Please make sure nearby residents
are alerted and can take precautions.

1197
01:20:00,140 --> 01:20:02,700
That Tokyo is in Japan

1198
01:20:02,700 --> 01:20:06,220
There have been failures of
the Kamikaze rocket before.

1199
01:20:06,220 --> 01:20:09,800
The question in this incident is the police.

1200
01:20:09,800 --> 01:20:10,480
Ryo-san?

1201
01:20:13,440 --> 01:20:14,900
The latest information from Japan

1202
01:20:14,900 --> 01:20:16,900
Today, appearing in Tokyo, Japan

1203
01:20:16,900 --> 01:20:18,860
A former member of a temporary prayer group

1204
01:20:18,860 --> 01:20:19,900
His Majesty of France

1205
01:20:19,900 --> 01:20:22,140
The multinational forces
of the American army

1206
01:20:22,140 --> 01:20:23,500
Preparations for air raids underway

1207
01:20:23,500 --> 01:20:24,900
I'm coming now!

1208
01:20:25,460 --> 01:20:27,520
Ryo-sama!

1209
01:20:46,880 --> 01:20:49,640
The rocket turns from the Ogawamachi
intersection onto Hibiya-dori

1210
01:20:49,640 --> 01:20:51,340
and is heading south toward Otemachi.

1211
01:20:51,340 --> 01:20:52,280
If we act now,

1212
01:20:52,280 --> 01:20:55,460
no good!
It'll explode from the friction heat!

1213
01:20:55,460 --> 01:20:56,160
What?

1214
01:21:00,620 --> 01:21:03,000
Right, if it keeps going like this,
it'll explode eventually!

1215
01:21:03,000 --> 01:21:04,080
What do you plan to do?

1216
01:21:04,080 --> 01:21:05,560
What do we do? What do we do?

1217
01:21:05,560 --> 01:21:08,800
You idiot!
You're the one who said you'd handle it!

1218
01:21:13,080 --> 01:21:13,440
That's right!

1219
01:21:14,000 --> 01:21:16,180
Second son! Please open Katsutoki Bridge!

1220
01:21:16,600 --> 01:21:18,140
Open Katsutoki Bridge?

1221
01:21:18,560 --> 01:21:20,320
What on earth are you planning to do?

1222
01:21:20,580 --> 01:21:23,100
Anyway,
let's do what the senior officer says.

1223
01:21:24,540 --> 01:21:26,340
Right! I get it, Ryotsu!

1224
01:21:29,100 --> 01:21:31,237
Even if you tell us to raise the bridge,

1225
01:21:31,287 --> 01:21:33,840
that was thirty years ago, you know.

1226
01:21:33,840 --> 01:21:36,540
Anyway, you have to do it,
or we're in big trouble!

1227
01:21:37,260 --> 01:21:40,200
Block all traffic on
Chūō-dōri and Hibiya-dori!

1228
01:21:40,540 --> 01:21:42,580
Order the nearby residents to evacuate!

1229
01:21:42,660 --> 01:21:43,200
Roger!

1230
01:21:47,080 --> 01:21:48,840
Count on you, Ryotsu!

1231
01:21:49,880 --> 01:21:53,240
The rocket is currently heading
from Ogawamachi toward Kanda.

1232
01:22:01,800 --> 01:22:02,440
Left?!

1233
01:22:07,620 --> 01:22:09,720
The rocket has entered Harumi-dōri.

1234
01:22:11,640 --> 01:22:13,640
From here it's a straight
shot to Katsutoki Bridge.

1235
