Hang in there!

1262
01:22:36,800 --> 01:22:37,500
Honda-san!

1263
01:22:39,260 --> 01:22:40,360
Isn't it open yet?

1264
01:22:40,500 --> 01:22:43,660
It seems he forgot,
since it was so long ago.

1265
01:22:44,380 --> 01:22:47,100
I should still remember big
sis's phone number, though.

1266
01:22:47,100 --> 01:22:49,420
The senior officer is
just around the corner!

1267
01:22:49,580 --> 01:22:50,740
We're running out of time!

1268
01:22:54,260 --> 01:22:57,520
He's coming, he's coming!
What do we do, what do we do!

1269
01:22:57,880 --> 01:22:58,840
I remember!

1270
01:23:00,240 --> 01:23:01,240
This is it, this one!

1271
01:23:02,440 --> 01:23:02,900
Here you go!

1272
01:23:06,840 --> 01:23:09,020
The power's on!

1273
01:23:09,900 --> 01:23:12,520
You, push down that lever over there!

1274
01:23:12,520 --> 01:23:14,440
Which one?

1275
01:23:21,420 --> 01:23:22,860
Hurry, we're out of time!

1276
01:23:23,760 --> 01:23:24,840
Don't panic!

1277
01:23:25,100 --> 01:23:27,060
Open Katsutoki Bridge!

1278
01:23:51,380 --> 01:23:53,060
Everyone, please look!

1279
01:23:53,340 --> 01:23:56,500
The Hachidoki Bridge is about to
rise for the first time in 30 years!

1280
01:23:56,820 --> 01:23:59,620
What on earth is going to happen now?

1281
01:23:59,820 --> 01:24:01,700
This is... the Hachidoki Bridge!

1282
01:24:20,960 --> 01:24:22,920
Yes!

1283
01:24:23,060 --> 01:24:24,000
Yes!

1284
